# eth_dma_2d_addr ND-strided walk formal proof (SymbiYosys).
#
# Proves the address walker of the 2D graphics DMA `eth_dma_2d` (E2-DMA2,
# S15 §3 "ND-strided 地址引擎") on its own, because the walker is where the
# ADDRESS-PER-ACCESS SAFETY of the whole device is decided:
#   W1  a line offered for transfer (safe_o) lies entirely inside the declared
#       window [WIN_LO, WIN_HI) AND inside the AXI address space (no carry out
#       of 2**AXI_AW), so every beat of that line -- line_addr + k*beat,
#       k < h_bytes/beat -- is inside the window.  `eth_dma_2d` issues beats
#       only for a line with safe_o, which is what makes the whole device
#       unable to touch memory outside its programmed framebuffer region;
#   W2  the walk never leaves the declared rectangle (y < VSIZE, z < PLANES in
#       every running cycle);
#   W3  addresses move only by the declared strides -- +LINE_STRIDE per line,
#       plane origin +PLANE_STRIDE per plane -- and a step whose addition would
#       carry out of 64 bits is refused (fault), never truncated, so the walk
#       can neither wrap nor silently reach an undeclared address;
#   W4  A_DONE is reachable only from the last line of the last plane, and no
#       accepted step is swallowed (each advances y, or z, or completes);
#   W5  DONE and FAULT are terminal until the next start (the walk cannot
#       restart itself);
#   W6  an armed walk is not restarted while running: `start_i` is ignored in
#       A_RUN and a running walk moves only on `step_i`;
#   W7  `abort_i` parks the walk from any state, which is how the engine
#       guarantees no walk survives into the next frame.
#
# Properties are one-step relations over (state, inputs, next state) or frozen
# output checks, so the proof holds by k-induction at UNBOUNDED depth -- no
# harness length bound and no property-only counting state.  The environment
# assumptions are the caller contract of `eth_dma_2d`: a legal rectangle
# (non-zero HSIZE/VSIZE/PLANES, non-zero line stride, non-empty window inside
# the AXI address space) whose geometry and window are held stable for the whole
# frame.  That stability is a hardware guarantee, not a promise: the engine
# copies every frame parameter into shadow registers at START and asserts that
# they are frozen while a frame runs (eth_dma_2d.sby, property S1).
#
# The cover task witnesses the running/complete/faulted states, so the safety
# proof is non-vacuous (a walk that can never fault would prove nothing about
# the guard).
#
# Run:  sby -f eth_dma_2d_addr.sby     (picked up by `make formal`)
[tasks]
prove
cover

[options]
prove: mode prove
prove: depth 24
cover: mode cover
cover: depth 24

[engines]
prove: smtbmc
cover: smtbmc

[script]
read -formal eth_dma_2d_addr.sv
prep -top eth_dma_2d_addr

[files]
ethereal-shell/rtl/dma/eth_dma_2d_addr.sv
